You can say, I was wired money from Spain, for example.

233
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:52,960
Right.

234
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:57,580
And one of the most famous places to do this that you'll find all over the United States is Western Union.

235
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:58,420
That's right.

236
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:01,820
You can go to them and say, I need to transfer money or I need to transfer funds.

